  - Speaker: Mariyati
    portrait: {fileID: 629400567948610330, guid: 7a46ddee279c0184094059a4d23d3e00, type: 3}
    Text: "\u201CWe need to defeat these creatures!\u201D"
  - Speaker: Mariyati
